    "summary": "Divine Intervention (Hallowed Martyrs) gets a new Effect. Spend anywhere from 1 to 3 Miracle dice; when the phase ends, put one CHARACTER model of your unit that was destroyed back on the battlefield, unengaged, at the nearest spot to where it died. It no longer belongs to any attached unit, and the unit it now forms has a starting strength equal to 1. Roll a D3 and add 1 for every Miracle dice spent: the model returns with that many wounds remaining, never more than the wounds it began the battle with.",
